{"id":"FMSC260","title":"Couples, Marriage, and Families: Intimate Relationship Across the Life Course","department":"Family Science","level":"Undergrad","credits":"3","description":"Covers the different aspects of couple relationships and family life. This includes common problems in couple relationships, and resources to strengthen couple and family relationships. You will also learn about stages of relationships, theories of love and family, policy related to couples and family formation, and how research is conducted with couples and families. Together, we will discuss and explore issues that couples and families face in modern times and will consider how many of these issues have changed due to policy, technology, attitudes, and a variety of other societal factors that impact relationships in the 21st century. You will also learn important methods of strengthening current and future relationships.","gradingMethods":null,"noLongerOffered":false,"removedTerm":null,"removedDetected":null,"terms":[{"term":"201801","sections":1,"seats":65,"openSeats":1,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"201805","sections":1,"seats":40,"openSeats":12,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"201808","sections":1,"seats":55,"openSeats":1,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"201905","sections":1,"seats":40,"openSeats":17,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"201908","sections":1,"seats":55,"openSeats":2,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"201912","sections":1,"seats":35,"openSeats":12,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"202001","sections":1,"seats":60,"openSeats":3,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"202005","sections":1,"seats":40,"openSeats":22,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Elise Resnick"],"removed":false},{"term":"202008","sections":1,"seats":55,"open